VERDICT TALLY, and the count is not the reason: codex REJECT AS WRITTEN, deepseek NOT
RATIFY, kimi-k3 NOT CLEAN AS FILED against agy/grok GO-WITH-CHANGES, glm FIX SHAPE
SOUND, minimax PASS.  **Every seat agrees the PRODUCT FIX's control flow is correct;
every objection is against the DETECTOR.**  That is the round's shape: the fix is
